components-button.description:
Lets users take actions and make choices with a single click or tap.

```jsx
import { Button } from '@wordpress/components';
const Mybutton = () => (
  <Button
    variant="primary"
    onClick={ handleClick }
  >
    Click here
  </Button>
);
```

